<title>USA: Montana Power's Colstrip 3 restarted.</title>
<headline>Montana Power's Colstrip 3 restarted.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 750 megawatt (MW) unit 3 at Montana Power's Colstrip power plant was restarted early Tuesday morning as expected, after shutting Saturday to repair a leaking tube, sources familiar with the plant's operations said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The coal-fired unit is expected to reach full capacity by early this afternoon.</p>
<p>The plant's other 750 MW unit and two 350 MW units were operating at full capacity, the sources said.</p>
<p>--Los Angeles bureau, + 1 213 955 6761</p>
</text>
